  "articleBody": "It's totally normal to wonder if a small space can really work for you. Many folks worry that a tiny home means sacrificing comfort or functionality, but that's a big misconception! At Zen Tiny Homes, we believe your home should be built around *you*, not the other way around. We start by really digging into how you live, cook, sleep, work, and even entertain. Our custom design process is all about rethinking space to create efficient layouts, clever storage solutions, and flexible living areas that truly feel open and personal. You won't find us just shrinking a standard house plan; we design every square foot intentionally so it genuinely supports your daily life. If you're feeling a bit lost on how to translate your lifestyle into a tiny footprint, that's exactly where our expertise comes in handy. Don't let those worries hold you back from exploring a truly personalized small home.",
